OL,3,CTwo people arrested after homes
OL,4,Cdestroyed by wildfire
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a large fire
OL,8,Fdamaged four homes in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,10,FStaffordshire Police said they
OL,11,Freceived a call from the local fire
OL,12,Fservice shortly before 4.15pm on
OL,13,FThursday, as fire crews responded to a
OL,14,Fgrass fire at the back of Maureen
OL,15,FAvenue which was spreading quickly.
OL,17,FA 23-year-old man and 24-year-old
OL,18,Fwoman, both from Stoke-on-Trent, have
OL,19,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of arson
OL,20,Fafter the incident.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
