OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786717110
OL,3,CTwo people arrested after homes
OL,4,Cdestroyed by wildfire
OL,6,FPolice say the fire, which has now
OL,7,Fbeen brought under control, affected
OL,8,Ffour homes and a number of gardens.
OL,10,FDetective Inspector Emma Kempson, from
OL,11,Fthe criminal investigations
OL,12,Fdepartment, said:
OL,14,F"We are continuing to work at pace to
OL,15,Finvestigate the circumstances
OL,16,Fsurrounding yesterday's fire, which
OL,17,Fhas culminated in the arrests today.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
