OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786717110
OL,3,CTwo people arrested after homes
OL,4,Cdestroyed by wildfire
OL,6,F"Goldenhill Community Centre on
OL,7,FDrummond Street was set up to provide
OL,8,Fsupport to evacuated individuals and
OL,9,Fothers affected.
OL,11,F"We're now working alongside Stoke-on-
OL,12,FTrent City Council and have moved the
OL,13,Flocation to Goldenhill Working Men's
OL,14,FClub on Mobberley Road."
OL,16,FThe Goldenhill Community Centre was
OL,17,Foverwhelmed with donations offers of
OL,18,Fhelp for residents living in nearby
OL,19,FMaureen Avenue and Sandy Road, who had
OL,20,Fto be evacuated on Thursday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@XO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
