OL,3,CTwo people arrested after homes
OL,4,Cdestroyed by wildfire
OL,6,FA Stoke-on-Trent resident said she
OL,7,F"couldn't believe" what was happening
OL,8,Fas a fire started feet away from her
OL,9,Fhome.
OL,11,FThe woman, who lives on Wignall Road,
OL,12,Fvisited the Goldenhill community
OL,13,Fcentre for support on Friday afternoon.
OL,15,FShe said friends living in nearby
OL,16,Froads have lost their homes due to the
OL,17,Ffire.
OL,19,FShe said: "I feel so sorry for them...
OL,20,Fit started nine feet away from my
OL,21,Fhouse.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@RO]{D@KOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
