OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786717110
OL,3,CTwo people arrested after homes
OL,4,Cdestroyed by wildfire
OL,6,F"I can't believe it. I could see smoke
OL,7,Fwhen I let the dog out and I didn't
OL,8,Fknow what the hell had happened.
OL,10,F"I've got a gas barbecue with gas
OL,11,Fbottles in the shed ` all I could
OL,12,Fthink about was that.
OL,14,F"My friends, two of their houses have
OL,15,Fgone. It's completely gone. I'm so
OL,16,Fsorry for them."
OL,18,FIt comes after a series of major
OL,19,Fwildfires engulfed the West Midlands
OL,20,Fon Thursday evening.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOUxD@PO]
